---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import { profileConfig } from "../config";
import { url } from "../utils/url-utils";
import ThreeHero from "./three/ThreeHero.astro";
---

<section class="card-base relative overflow-hidden mb-4 onload-animation">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_minmax(0,18rem)] items-center">
        <div class="relative z-10 px-8 pt-8 pb-2 md:py-10 md:pl-10 md:pr-0 order-2 md:order-1">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--primary)] mb-3">FRONTEND ENGINEER</div>
            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-90 leading-tight mb-4">
                트러블 슈팅이 좋은<br/>개발자, {profileConfig.name}입니다
            </h1>
            <p class="text-75 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                일하면서 부딪힌 문제를 끝까지 파고들고,<br class="hidden md:block"/>
                그 과정에서 배운 것을 이곳에 기록합니다.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pb-6 md:pb-0">
                <a href={url("/about/")} class="btn-regular rounded-lg h-10 px-4 font-bold active:scale-95">
                    소개 보기
                    <Icon name="material-symbols:arrow-forward-rounded" class="text-xl ml-1"></Icon>
                </a>
                <a href="https://github.com/seung365" target="_blank" class="btn-plain rounded-lg h-10 px-4 font-bold active:scale-95">
                    <Icon name="fa6-brands:github" class="text-lg mr-2"></Icon>
                    GitHub
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <ThreeHero class="order-1 md:order-2 h-56 md:h-72 w-full" />
    </div>
</section>
